)
To see the names of all 14 variables:

#Skylighting(([#BuiltInTok("list");#NormalTok("(students.columns)");],));
#Skylighting(([#NormalTok("['student_id',");],
[#NormalTok(" 'supervisor_id',");],
[#NormalTok(" 'age',");],
[#NormalTok(" 'gender',");],
[#NormalTok(" 'faculty',");],
[#NormalTok(" 'programme',");],
[#NormalTok(" 'study_mode',");],
