#Skylighting(([#NormalTok("students[");#StringTok("\"faculty\"");#NormalTok("] ");#OperatorTok("=");#NormalTok(" students[");#StringTok("\"faculty\"");#NormalTok("].astype(");#StringTok("\"category\"");#NormalTok(")");],
