== Reporting results in a thesis
<reporting-results-in-a-thesis>
Every empirical result in a thesis results chapter must report: 1. Descriptive metrics ($M$ and $S D$, or Median and IQR). 2. Test statistic, degrees of freedom, and exact $p$-value. 3. Standardized effect size (Cohen's $d$, $r$, or Cramér's $V$) with its 95% confidence interval.

