Study mode has a clear effect ($F approx 11.6 \, p < .001$). Programme does not ($p = 0.29$), and neither does the interaction ($p = 0.36$): part-time study lowers wellbeing by about the same amount whether a student is doing a Master's or a PhD. When an interaction #emph[is] significant, it should be interpreted before the main effects, because it means that no single "effect of study mode" describes everyone.

== Linear regression
<linear-regression>
ANOVA compares groups. #strong[Regression] goes further: it models how an outcome changes with one or more #strong[predictors], which can be numeric or categorical. It is the workhorse of quantitative research, and ANOVA is in fact a special case of it.

=== The regression line
<the-regression-line>
At its heart, regression describes the #strong[average outcome for given values of the predictors]. For sleep and GPA, the question is what the average GPA is among students who sleep 5 hours, among those who sleep 6 hours, and so on. These averages can be calculated directly, by grouping students into half-hour bands of sleep:

#Skylighting(([#NormalTok("sleep_bands ");#OperatorTok("=");#NormalTok(" (");],
[#NormalTok("    study.dropna(subset");#OperatorTok("=");#NormalTok("[");#StringTok("\"sleep_hours\"");#NormalTok("])");],
[#NormalTok("    .assign(sleep_band");#OperatorTok("=");#KeywordTok("lambda");#NormalTok(" d: (d[");#StringTok("\"sleep_hours\"");#NormalTok("] ");#OperatorTok("*");#NormalTok(" ");#DecValTok("2");#NormalTok(").");#BuiltInTok("round");#NormalTok("() ");#OperatorTok("/");#NormalTok(" ");#DecValTok("2");#NormalTok(")");],
[#NormalTok("    .groupby(");#StringTok("\"sleep_band\"");#NormalTok(")");],
[#NormalTok("    .agg(mean_gpa");#OperatorTok("=");#NormalTok("(");#StringTok("\"gpa\"");#NormalTok(", ");#StringTok("\"mean\"");#NormalTok("), students");#OperatorTok("=");#NormalTok("(");#StringTok("\"student_id\"");#NormalTok(", ");#StringTok("\"count\"");#NormalTok("))");],
[#NormalTok("    .reset_index()");],
[#NormalTok("    .sort_values(");#StringTok("\"sleep_band\"");#NormalTok(")");],
[#NormalTok(")");],
[#NormalTok("sleep_bands.head()");],));
#table(
  columns: 4,
  align: (auto,auto,auto,auto,),
  table.header(table.cell(align: right)[], table.cell(align: right)[sleep\_band], table.cell(align: right)[mean\_gpa], table.cell(align: right)[students],),
