[#NormalTok("    ");#StringTok("\"satisfaction\"");#NormalTok(": q.");#BuiltInTok("filter");#NormalTok("(like");#OperatorTok("=");#StringTok("\"satisfaction_\"");#NormalTok(").mean(axis");#OperatorTok("=");#DecValTok("1");#NormalTok("),");],
