[#NormalTok("shares[");#StringTok("\"Share (%)\"");#NormalTok("] ");#OperatorTok("=");#NormalTok(" (shares[");#StringTok("\"Share\"");#NormalTok("] ");#OperatorTok("*");#NormalTok(" ");#DecValTok("100");#NormalTok(").");#BuiltInTok("round");#NormalTok("(");#DecValTok("1");#NormalTok(")");],
[#BuiltInTok("print");#NormalTok("(shares.to_string(index");#OperatorTok("=");#VariableTok("False");#NormalTok("))");],));
#block[
#Skylighting(([#NormalTok("                      Level  Variance    Share  Share (%)");],
[#NormalTok("                 Supervisor 19.441951 0.132656       13.3");],
[#NormalTok("Student (within supervisor) 95.544907 0.651921       65.2");],
