The single call to #NormalTok("fit()"); calculates medians and scaling parameters on #NormalTok("X_train");, encodes categories, and fits the logistic regression model on the transformed data.

== Evaluating a classifier
<evaluating-a-classifier>
The model is now judged on the test students. Calling #NormalTok("predict()"); produces class labels ($0$ or $1$), and #NormalTok("predict_proba()"); produces the estimated probabilities:

