- In the header, #NormalTok("format: docx"); produces a Word document (the format most supervisors prefer for track-changes feedback), and #NormalTok("bibliography:"); names a file of references. The setting #NormalTok("execute: echo: false"); hides Python code in the finished document, so the thesis presents only polished narrative, tables, and figures.
