The structure is clear:

- #NormalTok("app_ui"); defines the layout: #NormalTok("page_sidebar()"); creates a modern sidebar containing #NormalTok("input_select()"); and #NormalTok("input_radio_buttons()");, alongside two content cards reserving spots for #NormalTok("output_plot(\"trend\")"); and #NormalTok("output_table(\"summary\")");.
- #NormalTok("server"); holds the logic: #NormalTok("@reactive.calc"); defines #NormalTok("selected()");, an intermediate filtered DataFrame that updates only when #NormalTok("input.faculty()"); changes. Both outputs consume #NormalTok("selected()");.
- #NormalTok("@render.plot"); and #NormalTok("@render.table"); produce the visual elements dynamically.

