[#NormalTok("    .");#BuiltInTok("apply");#NormalTok("(");#KeywordTok("lambda");#NormalTok(" s: ");#DecValTok("100");#NormalTok(" ");#OperatorTok("*");#NormalTok(" (s ");#OperatorTok("==");#NormalTok(" ");#StringTok("'Yes'");#NormalTok(").");#BuiltInTok("sum");#NormalTok("() ");#OperatorTok("/");#NormalTok(" ");#BuiltInTok("len");#NormalTok("(students))");],
