=== The workshop and its persistence (RQ3)
<the-workshop-and-its-persistence-rq3>
Students were randomly invited to the wellbeing workshop after the first semester. The mixed-effects model of Chapter 10 uses all four semesters and every student:

#block[
#Skylighting(([#NormalTok("panel ");#OperatorTok("=");#NormalTok(" semesters.merge(students, on");#OperatorTok("=");#StringTok("\"student_id\"");#NormalTok(").assign(time");#OperatorTok("=");#KeywordTok("lambda");#NormalTok(" d: d[");#StringTok("\"semester\"");#NormalTok("] ");#OperatorTok("-");#NormalTok(" ");#DecValTok("1");#NormalTok(")");],
[],
[#NormalTok("workshop_model ");#OperatorTok("=");#NormalTok(" smf.mixedlm(");],
[#NormalTok("    ");#StringTok("\"wellbeing ~ C(semester) * workshop\"");#NormalTok(",");],
[#NormalTok("    panel,");],
[#NormalTok("    groups");#OperatorTok("=");#NormalTok("panel[");#StringTok("\"student_id\"");#NormalTok("],");],
[#NormalTok("    re_formula");#OperatorTok("=");#StringTok("\"~time\"");],
[#NormalTok(").fit(method");#OperatorTok("=");#NormalTok("[");#StringTok("\"lbfgs\"");#NormalTok(", ");#StringTok("\"powell\"");#NormalTok("])");],
[],
[#NormalTok("pred_grid ");#OperatorTok("=");#NormalTok(" pd.MultiIndex.from_product(");],
[#NormalTok("    [[");#DecValTok("1");#NormalTok(", ");#DecValTok("2");#NormalTok(", ");#DecValTok("3");#NormalTok(", ");#DecValTok("4");#NormalTok("], [");#StringTok("\"Invited\"");#NormalTok(", ");#StringTok("\"Not invited\"");#NormalTok("]],");],
[#NormalTok("    names");#OperatorTok("=");#NormalTok("[");#StringTok("\"semester\"");#NormalTok(", ");#StringTok("\"workshop\"");#NormalTok("]");],
[#NormalTok(").to_frame().reset_index(drop");#OperatorTok("=");#VariableTok("True");#NormalTok(")");],
[#NormalTok("pred_grid[");#StringTok("\"time\"");#NormalTok("] ");#OperatorTok("=");#NormalTok(" pred_grid[");#StringTok("\"semester\"");#NormalTok("] ");#OperatorTok("-");#NormalTok(" ");#DecValTok("1");],
[#NormalTok("pred_grid[");#StringTok("\"predicted_wellbeing\"");#NormalTok("] ");#OperatorTok("=");#NormalTok(" workshop_model.predict(pred_grid)");],
[],
[#NormalTok("piv ");#OperatorTok("=");#NormalTok(" pred_grid.pivot(index");#OperatorTok("=");#StringTok("\"semester\"");#NormalTok(", columns");#OperatorTok("=");#StringTok("\"workshop\"");#NormalTok(", values");#OperatorTok("=");#StringTok("\"predicted_wellbeing\"");#NormalTok(")");],
[#NormalTok("gaps ");#OperatorTok("=");#NormalTok(" piv[");#StringTok("\"Invited\"");#NormalTok("] ");#OperatorTok("-");#NormalTok(" piv[");#StringTok("\"Not invited\"");#NormalTok("]");],
[#BuiltInTok("print");#NormalTok("(");#StringTok("\"Wellbeing gaps across semesters:\"");#NormalTok(")");],
[#BuiltInTok("print");#NormalTok("(gaps.");#BuiltInTok("round");#NormalTok("(");#DecValTok("1");#NormalTok("))");],));
#block[
#Skylighting(([#NormalTok("Wellbeing gaps across semesters:");],
[#NormalTok("semester");],
[#NormalTok("1    0.4");],
[#NormalTok("2    5.2");],
[#NormalTok("3    4.1");],
[#NormalTok("4    2.6");],
[#NormalTok("dtype: float64");],));
]
]
#quote(block: true)[
Wellbeing was similar in the two groups before the workshop (difference 0.4 points). After the workshop, invited students' wellbeing was 5.2 points higher in semester 2, but the difference narrowed to 4.1 points in semester 3 and 2.6 in semester 4.
