#strong[How to fix it:] - If working with a list, use Python's built-in #NormalTok("sum(scores) / len(scores)"); or numpy's #NormalTok("np.mean(scores)");. - If you intended to use pandas methods, convert the collection to a pandas Series: #NormalTok("pd.Series(scores).mean()");. - Check spelling: writing #NormalTok("df.val_counts()"); instead of #NormalTok("df.value_counts()");.

