#strong[Common causes:] - Forgetting the colon #NormalTok(":"); at the end of an #NormalTok("if");, #NormalTok("for");, #NormalTok("while");, or #NormalTok("def"); line. - Unmatched parentheses, brackets, or quotes: opening #NormalTok("("); without a matching #NormalTok(")");. - Using assignment #NormalTok("="); where a comparison #NormalTok("=="); was required (e.g.~#NormalTok("if x = 5:");).

